# Cloudflare Pages redirect map for energy.sunlogic.co.za.
#
# This site used to carry the electrical division's pages as well: both
# division sites were built from the same page set and shared one nav, so
# each shipped a byte-identical copy of the other's work. They have been
# removed so the site reads as the Energy division's rather than as a
# two-trade site with the other trade bolted on.
#
# These send anything already indexed — or bookmarked, or linked from
# someone else's site — to the division that now owns the page, rather than
# to a 404.
#
# 301, not 302: the move is permanent, and only a 301 passes ranking on.
#
# Both spellings are listed because scripts/build-site.js rewrites links to
# the extensionless form while Cloudflare Pages 308s /solar.html to /solar —
# so a link written the old way lands in one hop rather than two.
#
# Not processed by the build: rewriteHost and rewriteToExtensionless walk
# files by extension (.html/.xml/.txt/.js/.json) and this file has none. What
# is written here is what ships.

